{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2co-4-1","title":"2 Corinthians 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He declares how he has used all sincerity and faithful diligence in preaching the gospel, 7 and how the troubles and persecutions which he daily endured for the same did redound to the praise of God's power, 12 to the benefit of the church, 16 and to the apostle's own eternal glory.</p>\n<p>seeing. 3:6,12; 5:18; Eph 3:7,8 as. 1Co 7:25; 1Ti 1:13; 1Pe 2:10 we faint not. 16; Isa 40:30; Ga 6:9; Eph 3:13; Php 4:13; 2Th 3:13; *marg: Heb 12:3; Re 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-4-2","title":"2 Corinthians 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>renounced. 1Co 4:5 dishonesty. or, shame. Ro 1:16; 6:21; Eph 5:12 not. 1:12; 2:17; 11:3,6,13-15; Eph 4:14; 1Th 2:3-5 by. 5:11; 6:4-7; 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-4-3","title":"2 Corinthians 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>our. Ro 2:16; 1Th 1:5; 1Ti 1:11 it is. 4; 2:15,16; 3:14; Mt 11:25; 1Co 1:18; 2Th 2:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-4-4","title":"2 Corinthians 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the god. Mt 4:8,9; Joh 12:31,40; 14:30; 16:11; 1Co 10:20; Eph 2:2; 6:12 1Jo 5:19; *Gr: Re 20:2,3 blinded. 3:14; 1Ki 22:22; Isa 6:10; Joh 12:40 test. 6; 3:8,9,11,18; Joh 8:12; 12:35; Ac 26:18; Col 1:27; 1Ti 1:11 Tit 2:13 the image. Joh 1:14,18; 12:45; 14:9,10; 15:24; Php 2:6; Col 1:15; Heb 1:3 shine. 6; Ps 50:2; Isa 60:1,2; 2Pe 1:19; 1Jo 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-4-5","title":"2 Corinthians 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>we. Mt 3:11; Joh 1:21-23; 3:27-31;